# The panel boxes and the vehicle's parameters: setWPParams reads them in, Write sets them back.
#
# Activate runs setWPParams, which reads WP Radius from WP_RADIUS, WPNAV_RADIUS (cm) or, from 4.7,
# WP_RADIUS_M, written {0:N2}, and Loiter Radius from LOITER_RADIUS or WP_LOITER_RAD - disabling it
# when the vehicle has neither, as a copter does (GCSViews/FlightPlanner.cs:6695-6750). Write's
# saveWPs, once the mission is on the vehicle, sets the radius into all three names - "use brute
# force, for all three possible params" - and Loiter Radius into LOITER_RAD or WP_LOITER_RAD
# (:6296-6317). setParam passes over a name the vehicle does not have (MAVLinkInterface.cs:1640),
# so on this copter only WP_RADIUS_M is set. plan.params is what each set did, from the vehicle's
# own echo through the link's retrying set_param.
#
# Needs SITL (a copter): tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/plan-panel-params.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml
env XDG_DATA_HOME $WORK
env MP_PLAN_DIR $WORK

screen params
window 1600x1200
budget 14
# RawParamWarning, on the Full Parameter List's Activate (ConfigRawParams.cs:92): "Show me
# again?" unticked, so no later visit asks, and OK.
# The vehicle first: a click before its first heartbeat is a click the screen may forget
# (vehicle.connected only says the link is open).
expect vehicle.count > 0
click raw-param-warning-again
click raw-param-warning-ok

click param-download
expect params.held > 500

# The planning screen shown reads the radii in.
click tab-plan
expect plan.wprad 2.00
expect plan.loiterrad.enabled false
expect plan.prompt none

# A home from the vehicle, one waypoint, a radius of 3, and Write.
click plan-home-link
expect mission.home true
# The map first: a press before its first paint records nothing.
expect map.ready true
click map@0.45x0.40
expect mission.items 1
click plan-wprad
key ctrl+u
type 3
click plan-write
expect plan.params.busy false
expect plan.params ~ WP_RADIUS=unknown
expect plan.params ~ WP_RADIUS_M=3
expect plan.params ~ WPNAV_RADIUS=unknown
expect plan.params ~ WP_LOITER_RAD=unknown

# Shown again, the planning screen reads back what was set.
click tab-fly
click tab-plan
expect plan.wprad 3.00

# Put the vehicle's radius back as it was, for whatever runs next.
click plan-wprad
key ctrl+u
type 2
click plan-write
expect plan.params ~ WP_RADIUS_M=2
